  "description": "Keane Thompson Estate Agents are proud to present 45 Weavers Hall, Levmoss Park, The Gallops, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, a superb one-bedroom, third-floor apartment extending to approximately 54 sq. m. and presented in excellent condition throughout.\nEnjoying a west-facing aspect and overlooking the open green space of Orby Park, this bright and spacious apartment benefits from excellent natural light and a wonderful sense of privacy. The west-facing balcony, accessed directly from the living room, is an ideal spot to relax and enjoy the afternoon and evening sunshine while taking in the attractive views towards the Dublin Mountains.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and generously proportioned open-plan living and dining room, a modern fully fitted kitchen, a spacious double bedroom and a contemporary bathroom. The living room is particularly impressive, featuring large windows that frame the views over Orby Park and a door providing direct access to the private balcony.\n\nThe bedroom is well proportioned and benefits from built-in wardrobes and excellent natural light, while the modern bathroom is fully tiled and finished to a high standard. A separate utility/storage area provides additional practicality and useful storage space.\nA significant benefit of this property is the secure underground parking, providing residents with designated secure parking in addition to the well-maintained communal areas within the development.\n\nLevmoss Park is a highly regarded development situated in The Gallops, Leopardstown, offering residents a peaceful residential setting while remaining within easy reach of an excellent range of amenities. The nearby LUAS Green Line at The Gallops provides swift and convenient access to Dublin city centre, while the M50 and N11 are also easily accessible.\n\nThe location is particularly well positioned for those working in Sandyford Business District, Leopardstown and surrounding areas, with a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, gyms and leisure facilities all close by. There are also numerous walking and recreational opportunities in the surrounding area.\nWith its excellent condition, west-facing balcony, open parkland views, generous living accommodation and secure underground parking, 45 Weavers Hall represents an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor seeking a quality apartment in a highly desirable Dublin 18 location.\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, outlook and location of this excellent apartment.\n\nAccommodation\n54 Sqm Approx.\n\nEntrance Hall\nLaminate flooring, storage press.  \n\nKitchen \nTiled floor and splashback, fitted cabinets, integrated appliances, recessed lighting. \n\nUtility \nTiled floor, plumbed for washing machine, shelving. \n\nLiving Room\nLaminate flooring, access to balcony, floor to ceiling windows. \n\nBedroom \nLaminate flooring, floor to ceiling windows, fitted wardrobe. \n\nBathroom\nFully tiled, mirrored cabinets, bathtub with shower attachment",
